{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27355","headline":"江上蚊子 · 常楚老","name":"江上蚊子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘摇挟翅亚红腹，江边夜起如雷哭。\n请问贪婪一点心，臭腐填腹几多足。\n越女如花住江曲，嫦娥夜夜凝双睩。\n怕君撩乱锦窗中，十轴轻绡围夜玉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常楚老","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}